 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? You sure can. Lots of people do it, and there are tools like laptop stands that keep your computer at eye level. Then think about it. A full desk takes up space that could be living room, and it needs cleaning around too. Sleeping during the day saves both. Then maybe get a comfortable outdoor chair for mornings, and use the bed for sleeping. switch between them. You can use a pillow to support your neck. Sleeping on a firm mat is also an option.",
